      "format": "markdown",
      "text": "The first differential failure exposed a Windows-specific stream detail: the Rust binary emits raw LF even on Windows, while Python translated `\\n` to CRLF. That is exactly the sort of observable mismatch this benchmark targets; I’m correcting the process stream configuration at the entrypoint, then rerunning the full differential set and allowing the Rust test build enough time to complete rather than treating its initial compile timeout as evidence."
    }
